y; they are not physical supplies.\nHost off: 3V3_HOST=0, host pullups also0; TCA9517 separates local domain. Keep common ground connected." (at 15.24 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "748f971c-bb97-53ab-bb79-162d476bc295")) )
